OL,3,GNEWSA'Delight' as solar farm refused
OL,4,Aplanning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a controversial #800m
OL,7,Fsolar farm have been refused by the
OL,8,Fgovernment.
OL,10,FThe 840MW Botley West in Oxfordshire
OL,11,Fwould have spread across more than
OL,12,F2,000 acres of land to the north and
OL,13,Fwest of Oxford.
OL,15,FBut Baroness Margaret Curran, on behalf
OL,16,Fof the Secretary of State for Energy
OL,17,FSecurity and Net Zero, said
OL,18,F"substantial" harm would be caused to
OL,19,Fgreenbelt and heritage assets, as well
OL,20,Fas negative impacts on the landscape.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
