OL,3,GNEWSA'Delight' as solar farm refused
OL,4,Aplanning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Orme from the group Stop Botley
OL,7,FWest said the news had "restored a bit
OL,8,Fof faith" in the planning process.
OL,9,FDeveloper Photovolt Development
OL,10,FPartners (PVDP) has been approached for
OL,11,Fa comment.
